   "does": "Claims for app-recorded workouts precomputedLoad = TrainingLoadPrecedence.stored with tiers power (storedPowerTSS, else readTimePowerTSS from NP and today's FTP for the sport, moving time), routeHistory when routeEstimateReplacesHRLoad, hr (hrTSS, LTHR fallback 0.88 × HRmax in WorkoutAnalyzer.computeHrTSS), mets (computedMETLoad, 12 METs anchor), banister (luciaTRIMP; Edwards fallback in WorkoutAnalyzer), routeHistory; same order as WorkoutMetadata.preferredTrainingLoad; runs off main; HealthKit workouts carry no precomputedLoad. Verified TrainingLoadPrecedence.swift:83-111, WorkoutMetadata.swift:659-666,709-721, WorkoutAnalyzer.swift:347-356, WorkoutMetadata.swift:627. The two ladders are separate copies (stored vs preferredTrainingLoad) kept in the same order.",
